          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پیگیری کردن (peygiri kardan) — \"to follow up, to pursue\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خبرنگار این خبر را تا آخر پیگیری کرد. Khabarnegâr in khabar râ tâ âkhar peygiri kard. The journalist followed this story through to the end."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pey \"footstep, track\" + giri \"taking\": to keep following the trail of something. Present peygiri mikonad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "peygiri joins pey \"footstep, track\" and giri \"taking\", from gereftan \"to take\", both native Persian; kardan \"to do\" is inherited too. EtymDB lists no entry for the compound."
            }
          ]
        },
