          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خبر دادن (khabar dâdan) — \"to let someone know, to tell the news\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دوستم به من خبر داد که برادرش ازدواج کرده است. Dustam be man khabar dâd ke barâdarash ezdevâj karde ast. My friend let me know that his brother had got married."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person told takes be: be mâdaram khabar dâdam. Present stem dah-."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "khabar \"news\" is borrowed from Arabic khabar (EtymDB). dâdan \"to give\" is inherited Persian: to give the news."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
